## The city of the dwarfs and the well.

## Room 49. LOOK.BAS 4900 and 4950.

create the Dwarf City
  a room
  room name:
    Dwarf city
  exits, one-way: north to the Dwarf Door, northeast to the Hall of Doors

  You are in the city of the dwarfs. The buildings are too small{br}
  to enter. Passages go north and south.

## Room 50. LOOK.BAS 5000 and 5050.

create the Dwarf Door
  a room
  room name:
    Dwarf door
  exits, one-way: north to the Short Passage, northeast to the Dwarf City, out to the Short Passage

  passage to the Short Passage
    grammar
      door
  end passage

  passage to the Short Passage
    grammar
      barrier
  end passage

  You are standing west of a large door, probably built by dwarfs.

## Room 51. LOOK.BAS 5100 and 5150.

create the Short Passage
  a room
  room name:
    you are in a short passage running E/W.
  exits, one-way: north to the Well, east to the Well

  you are in a short passage running E/W.

## Room 52. LOOK.BAS 5200 and 5250.

create the Well
  a room
  room name:
    Well
  exits, one-way: west to the Short Passage, out to the Short Passage

  You are at the top of a well, which appears to be bottomless.
